optionOf: dragon-like
description: >
  Dragon Lord’s Rage [Triggered, 1/Round]: If a Studied Ally on an adjacent Square targets an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver, you may use the United Attack Maneuver without spending an Action through its effects.
